00 mm PU food grade, bought through your US distributor, fitted per the belt replacement section of the Rev B manual, d=
irection of travel checked against the arrow on the belt.</p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Since then the belt runs left. Looking downstream toward the wrapper, left is the motor side. It=
